An indented continuation row continues the table above

```
  | h |
  | v |
  + text |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>h</td></tr>
    <tr><td>v text</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| v |
  + t |

- | a |
    + b |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>v t</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<ul>
  <li>
    <table>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>a b</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
| a |

  + b |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<p>+ b |</p>
```
